        &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Reassembled fragmented area&quot;,
        &quot;description&quot;: &quot;One portion of the artefact is severely fragmented. In this area, the restoration process consisted solely of the spatial reassembly of the surviving fragments, which were repositioned adjacent to one another according to their original arrangement, without physical reintegration of the missing areas.&quot;,
